              "alt_id": [
                "ensure-compat-rsv"
              ],
              "content": "<p>For all <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG22/#dfn-user-interface-components\" title=\"a part of the content that is perceived by users as a single control for a distinct function\">user interface components</a>, the <a href=\"#dfn-name\" title=\"text by which software can identify a component within web content to the user\">name</a> and role can be programmatically determined:\n   </p>\n   <ul>\n      <li>form elements</li>\n      <li>links and <em>components generated by scripts</em></li>\n   </ul>\n   <div class=\"note\" role=\"note\" id=\"issue-container-generatedID-44\"><div class=\"note-title marker\" id=\"h-note-44\"><span>Note</span></div><p class=\"\">This success criterion is primarily for web authors who develop or script their own\n      user interface components.</p></div>\n   <ol><li>first <strong>step</strong></li><li>second<br>line</li></ol>\n   <dl><dt>Controls</dt><dd><p>Has a <code>name</code>.</p></dd><dt>Media</dt><dd><p>Has a description.</p></dd></dl>",
